Maintainer: Miroslav Machynka (Trebired) <noreply@trebired.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/trebired/admitpress
Depends: qml6-module-org-kde-kirigami,
 qml6-module-org-kde-desktop,
