Recommends: adwaita-icon-theme, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
Description: Design and print sequential admission tickets
 This application designs admission tickets and prints them in order, so every
 ticket that leaves the printer carries the next number in the sequence.
 It keeps a daily counter for each price, records every sale, and submits
 print jobs to CUPS.
